{
  "slug": "upkeep",
  "name": "Upkeep",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "macOS cleanup and update assistant for Claude Code.\nScans your Mac for reclaimable disk space, leftover app data, stale caches, broken LaunchAgents, and shell configuration drift, then helps you clean it up safely with your approval. It can also update your AI skills and developer package managers in one pass, including Homebrew, npm, pip, gems, and rustup.\n\nModes\n•\tDeep — full 15-phase audit and cleanup\n•\tQuick — fast cache cleanup plus Homebrew updates\n•\tAudit — report only, with no changes made\n•\tUpdate — refresh AI skills and package managers",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `audit` (Full system disk audit — report only, never removes anything), `cleandeep` (Full system deep clean), `cleanquick` (Fast cache sweep), `update` (Update AI skills, Claude Code plugins, and package managers in one sweep), `upkeep` (Cross-platform system cleanup and updates for macOS 14+, Linux (Debian/Ubuntu, Fedora/RHEL, Arch), and WSL2)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install upkeep@claude-community` from `KyleNesium/upkeep` (`upkeep`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 1
  },
